From 0c7d6525cc5e80188827a514d2edcb904e34733f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:29:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): honest live-games list, real cookie consent, clearer
 nav/footer, accessibility
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Live games
- Add Room::live() scope + xiangqi.live_window_hours (env XIANGQI_LIVE_WINDOW_HOURS,
  default 24, 0 disables). Games abandoned without a result (result IS NULL) were
  listed as "live" for days. Used by the homepage boards and /thi-dau.
- Homepage "đang thi đấu" heading now links to /thi-dau instead of the members list.

Cookie consent
- Rebuild the banner as a real fixed bar with equal-weight Accept/Reject and a
  privacy link. The old Tailwind-style classes (fixed, bottom-0, hidden md:inline)
  were never defined in the Bootstrap 4 stylesheet.
- Wire the choice into Google Consent Mode v2: EEA/UK/CH default to denied until
  accepted, all other regions keep the previous behaviour. A stored choice
  (cookie 1/0) is restored on every page load; a rejection is kept for 180 days.

Navigation and footer
- Group the 8-item "Thi đấu" dropdown into Chơi / Cộng đồng / Luyện tập & lưu trữ.
- Footer: move partner/affiliate links into their own "Dự án khác" column
  (rel="sponsored" on the referral link) and drop the W3C validator badges.

Accessibility and copy
- The header brand is no longer the page <h1>; every page gets exactly one real
  <h1> (pages that render their own opt out via @section('hasPageH1')).
- Puzzle cards: like/hard/unsolved counters have text labels for touch and screen
  readers, and the puzzle name is a real link.
- Fix rules typos in vi.json (chuột -> chốt, chử -> chữ, chổ -> chỗ, giử -> giữ,
  nữa -> nửa).
- Add 6 new UI strings to all 9 language files; bump index_new.css to v=75.
